{
  "uid": "mohawk-live-multikrum-federated",
  "title": "Sovereign Mohawk | Live Multi-Krum & Federated Learning",
  "description": "Live orchestrator Multi-Krum decisions and gradient submissions from PRs #417-#420. Queries are scoped to job=\"orchestrator\" because node agents expose the same registered collectors with zero values.",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "tags": [
    "mohawk",
    "v2",
    "multikrum",
    "federated-learning",
    "live"
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Per-Batch Decisions",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Multi-Krum Batches by Result (5m)",
      "description": "Batch outcomes from mohawk_orchestrator_multikrum_batches_total{result=success|error}.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-main"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (result) (increase(mohawk_orchestrator_multikrum_batches_total{job=\"orchestrator\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{result}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-main"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Filtered Gradients (5m)",
      "description": "Gradients rejected by Multi-Krum, from mohawk_orchestrator_multikrum_filtered_total.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-main"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(mohawk_orchestrator_multikrum_filtered_total{job=\"orchestrator\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "filtered",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-main"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Selected Gradients (last batch)",
      "description": "Gauge mohawk_orchestrator_multikrum_selected records the last batch's selection count.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-main"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(mohawk_orchestrator_multikrum_selected{job=\"orchestrator\"})",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-main"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Filtered Decision Share (10m)",
      "description": "Filtered share of all per-node Multi-Krum decisions; sustained values near 1 mean every gradient is being rejected.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-main"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(mohawk_orchestrator_multikrum_node_decisions_total{job=\"orchestrator\",result=\"filtered\"}[10m])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(mohawk_orchestrator_multikrum_node_decisions_total{job=\"orchestrator\"}[10m])), 1e-9)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-main"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.9
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Last Orchestrator Round",
      "description": "Atomic maximum round observed by the orchestrator.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-main"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(mohawk_orchestrator_last_round{job=\"orchestrator\"})",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-main"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Orchestrator Scrape Up",
      "description": "Prometheus scrape health for the orchestrator metrics endpoint.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-main"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up{job=\"orchestrator\"}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-main"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Per-Node Decisions and Gradient Submissions",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Per-Node Multi-Krum Decisions (5m)",
      "description": "Selected/filtered decision counters per node; aggregate counters alone cannot attribute a rejection.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-main"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (node, result) (increase(mohawk_orchestrator_multikrum_node_decisions_total{job=\"orchestrator\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{node}} {{result}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-main"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Gradient Submissions by Node and Task (5m)",
      "description": "Accepted gradient submissions from mohawk_orchestrator_gradients_received_total{node,task}.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-main"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 15
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (node, task) (increase(mohawk_orchestrator_gradients_received_total{job=\"orchestrator\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{node}} / {{task}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-main"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Federation Demo Tier Stats",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Tier statistics are HTTP-only (no Prometheus series)",
      "description": "The federation demo exposes tier stats only over HTTP /stats; there is no Prometheus series for them yet.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Federation demo tier stats\n\n`cmd/federation-demo` publishes per-tier counters on its stats endpoint only; **no Prometheus series exist for them yet**, so this dashboard cannot chart them. Query each tier's `/stats` endpoint (for example `http://<host>:9130/stats` for a global tier and `http://<host>:9131/stats` for a regional tier) and inspect `gradients_received`, `gradients_aggregated`, and `parent_latency_ms`. For a two-tier demo, correlate tiers by the aggregate norm: a regional `multi-krum` line and a global `mean-fallback` line carrying the same norm is expected behavior with a single child."
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ]
}
